.TH TOFM 1 "November 2026" "tofm 0.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
tofm \- TakeoutFM in the terminal: music, radio, podcasts, movies and TV from a Takeout server
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tofm
.RB [ \-\-help ]
.RB [ \-\-version ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B tofm
browses and plays what a Takeout media server has: artists, albums, playlists, radio stations
and podcasts play in the terminal (through libmpv); movies and TV episodes open in
.BR mpv (1).
It signs in with a device code: open the link it shows on a device that's already signed in
and enter the code.
.PP
Covers are drawn with coloured block characters, so they show in any terminal, over SSH and in
tmux.
.SH KEYS
.TP
.BR "\(ua \(da" ", " "j k"
Move.
.TP
.BR Enter ", " "\(->" ", " l
Open, or play.
.TP
.BR "\(<-" ", " h ", " Esc
Back.
.TP
.B Tab
The sidebar.
.TP
.B /
Find in the list (on Search, a new search; also
.BR s ).
.TP
.BR "a" ", " "n"
Add a track to the end of the queue; play it next.
.TP
.B f
Favorite (\[u2665]) a track.
.TP
.BR d ", " x ", " R
Download an episode; remove a download; retry a failed one.
.TP
.B space
Play or pause.
.TP
.BR "<" ", " ">"
Previous, next.
.TP
.BR "[" ", " "]"
Back 10 seconds, ahead 30 seconds.
.TP
.B r
Repeat: off, all, one.
.TP
.B p
Now Playing and the queue.
.TP
.B ?
All the keys.
.TP
.B S
Sign out.
.TP
.B q
Quit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/tofm/
The library cache, play history and downloads
.RI ( media/ ).
.TP
.I ~/.config/tofm/tofm.conf
tofm's own settings (album art, the cover in the Now Playing bar).
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/tofm/tofm.log
Warnings from Qt, mpv and the keyring, kept off the screen.
.TP
.I ~/.cache/tofm/covers/
Album covers.
.PP
The sign-in is kept in the Secret Service (KWallet, GNOME Keyring). Without one (over SSH, on a
headless computer) it is kept in
.IR ~/.local/share/tofm/secrets.json ,
which only the user can read.
.SH NOTES
Media controllers see tofm through MPRIS as
.BR tofm :
.B playerctl \-p tofm play-pause
works. The media token is never put on
.BR mpv 's
command line, where other users could see it.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mpv (1),
.BR playerctl (1),
.UR https://takeout.fm
.UE
